{"id":29596,"slug":"all-about-eve","title":"All About Eve","year":1950,"country":"United States","duration":138,"spine":1003,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/29596-all-about-eve","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/1c91f165c290f8ffe0bace3ee64388b1/odCJzrBsQYPgTH6WkfEEvTOiu7xvpR_large.jpg","description":"In Joseph L. Mankiewicz’s devastatingly witty Hollywood classic, backstage is where the real drama plays out. One night, Margo Channing (Bette Davis) entertains a surprise dressing-room visitor: her most adoring fan, the shy, wide-eyed Eve Harrington (Anne Baxter). But as Eve becomes a fixture in Margo’s life, the Broadway legend soon realizes that her supposed admirer intends to use her and everyone in her circle, including George Sanders’s acid-tongued critic, as stepping-stones to stardom. Featuring stiletto-sharp dialogue and direction by Mankiewicz, and an unforgettable Davis in the role that revived her career and came to define it, the multiple-Oscar-winning All About Eve is the most deliciously entertaining film ever made about the ruthlessness of show business.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Joseph L. Mankiewicz","slug":"joseph-l-mankiewicz"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Bette Davis","role":"Margo Channing","slug":"bette-davis"},{"actor":"Anne Baxter","role":"Eve Harrington","slug":"anne-baxter"},{"actor":"George Sanders","role":"Addison DeWitt","slug":"george-sanders"},{"actor":"Celeste Holm","role":"Karen Richards","slug":"celeste-holm"},{"actor":"Gary Merrill","role":"Bill Sampson","slug":"gary-merrill"},{"actor":"Hugh Marlowe","role":"Lloyd Richards","slug":"hugh-marlowe"},{"actor":"Gregory Ratoff","role":"Max Fabian","slug":"gregory-ratoff"},{"actor":"Thelma Ritter","role":"Birdie","slug":"thelma-ritter"},{"actor":"Marilyn Monroe","role":"Miss Casswell","slug":"marilyn-monroe"},{"actor":"Barbara Bates","role":"Phoebe","slug":"barbara-bates"},{"actor":"Walter Hampden","role":"Aged actor","slug":"walter-hampden"}],"cred